- Child ID has depth 1
- Grandchild has depth 2
- parent_id() returns correct parent
- parent_id() returns None for root
- next_child_id() increments counter
- Child counter survives restart
- Multiple children numbered sequentially
- is_child_of() works for direct and indirect
