## Dependencies
- SQLite Storage Layer Core
- Database Schema & Migrations
- ID Generation & Content Hashing

## Rationale
Hierarchical IDs make epic/sub-issue relationships human-readable. The bd-abc.1 format is easier to understand than separate parent/child UUIDs. Sequential numbering within a parent preserves creation order and makes IDs predictable.

