- Empty label rejected
- Label with invalid chars rejected
- Empty comment content rejected
- Multiple validation errors collected

## Dependencies
- Model Types (Issue, Dependency, Label, Comment)
- Error Handling Module

## Rationale
Validation prevents garbage data from entering the database. Clear error messages help users fix issues quickly. Collecting all errors (rather than fail-fast) enables users to fix multiple problems in one attempt.

